# Rust service discipline

Return Result and propagate with ? instead of unwrap in library paths.
Document every unsafe block with a safety comment.

Match existing crate layout (src/bin, workspace members). Do not add a
second async runtime when one is already chosen.

Prefer existing error types and logging crates over new dependencies.
